{
 "comment": [
  "Upstream audio for the Shibuya scene (RUN 12.1). Every source is CC0-1.0, checked on its own page.",
  "`npm run fetch:audio` downloads these into assets/audio/upstream/ (git-ignored) and refuses to",
  "continue unless every sha256 matches. `npm run convert:audio` trims, loudness-normalises and",
  "encodes the clips below into public/audio/, which is what the repository ships (CC0 permits it).",
  "Clip `start`/`end` are seconds into the decoded source; `member` names a file inside a zip."
